  "description": {
    "text": "The 2014 Pokémon World Championships, held from 15 to 17 August 2014 at the Walter E. Washington Convention Center in Washington, D.C. Competitors got Champions Festival in seven languages, staff a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Champion.\n\nTrophy cards went to the top four of each age division in both the card game and the video game championships, with new full-art pictures by 5ban Graphics: Pikachu cheering beside a gold cup in a shower of confetti.",
